      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR FLASH CHISEL (7) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Bulli over 472m behind Lucky Biscuit (27.32) in a Mix. The form out of last race has been strong. Should be very hard to beat this time. ZIPPING KESHA (5) was a strong winner (20.80) from box 8 last time, scoring by 3 lengths at this track. Has a tricky draw to overcome and will need a clean break. One of main contenders. HIGH DISTINCTION (3) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (29.93) at this track behind Zipping Hamilton in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Expected to be in this for a long way. RITA'S HAIRCUT (2) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
